I assume this is because it writes after the router is disposed, you can override this by using:

```js
router: {...historyRouter(), dispose() {

      if (typeof window === 'object' && this._onPopState) {
        window.removeEventListener('popstate', this._onPopState);
      }


    if (this.writeTimer) {
      clearTimeout(this.writeTimer);
    }
} },
```
